The player can recruit Cats from the [[The Burgle Cats/Gacha|Cat Hunter menu]]. Most Cats have a [[The Burgle Cats/Burgle Abilities|special skill]] for Burgle Battles. Each skill requires a different amount of SP to use, which can be gained when exploring the opponent's mansion during battle. Getting duplicates of the same Cat will reduce SP needed for it to use its skill, up to a maximum of 10 copies of each Cat. Past that point, any subsequent duplicates will be refunded to the player in gold depending on the Cat's rarity:

